print("[ATA] exact address must match local Token or Token-2022 derivation")
print("[ORDER] CreateIdempotent inserted before DLMM Swap in every candidate")
print("[RPC] no ATA-readiness RPC added")
print("[FORWARD] same exact-account invariant preserved")
